<title>ITALY: DeBenedetti merges Italian news publishers - source.</title>
<headline>DeBenedetti merges Italian news publishers - source.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian news publisher L'Espresso, part of Carlo de Benedetti's industrial holding group CIR, is to incorporate its subsidiary news publisher La Repubblica, sources close to the editorial group said.</p>
<p>No more details of the operation were available.</p>
<p>Shares of press publishers L'Espresso and La Repubblica were suspended earlier on Tuesday on the Italian stock market pending an announcement. Repubblica shares closed on Monday at 2410 lire while L'Espresso shares closed at 5400 lire.</p>
<p>-- Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
